    {
     "title": "Photo Mode",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]A little camera, with a note: “Take snapshots to remember your eternal torment.”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]A simple Photo Mode has been added.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]Access it from the Pause Menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Several Eternities (New Game+)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]Now, when you complete the game, it should not wipe any achievement progress. This should help with several achievements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]Your Decks, Stickers, and other items are kept.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]Your Soul count is kept.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]Stickers in the world come back, so you can get them again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]All enemies have increased health.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for sending me bug reports and save files. A lot of these issues were missed before launch, and I apologize for any lost progress you might have gotten. Luckily with the bug reports and save files, we were able to reproduce many of the issues and verify a safe fix. Thank you for your patience as I deal with the tiny demons running this game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "I’m continuing work on some more secretive things, some of which you’ve asked for, and some of which will be an unasked Gift from the Devil. Talk soon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]- Sam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
